{"words": [{"text": "بِئْسَمَا", "translation": "Evil (is) that"}, {"text": "ٱشْتَرَوْا۟", "translation": "(for) which they have sold"}, {"text": "بِهِۦٓ", "translation": "with"}, {"text": "أَنفُسَهُمْ", "translation": "themselves"}, {"text": "أَن", "translation": "that"}, {"text": "يَكْفُرُوا۟", "translation": "they disbelieve"}, {"text": "بِمَآ", "translation": "in what"}, {"text": "أَنزَلَ", "translation": "has revealed"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهُ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "بَغْيًا", "translation": "grudging"}, {"text": "أَن", "translation": "that"}, {"text": "يُنَزِّلَ", "translation": "sends down"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهُ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "مِن", "translation": "of"}, {"text": "فَضْلِهِۦ", "translation": "His Grace"}, {"text": "عَلَىٰ", "translation": "on"}, {"text": "مَن", "translation": "whom"}, {"text": "يَشَآءُ", "translation": "He wills"}, {"text": "مِنْ", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "عِبَادِهِۦ ۖ", "translation": "His servants"}, {"text": "فَبَآءُو", "translation": "So they have drawn (on themselves)"}, {"text": "بِغَضَبٍ", "translation": "wrath"}, {"text": "عَلَىٰ", "translation": "upon"}, {"text": "غَضَبٍۢ ۚ", "translation": "wrath"}, {"text": "وَلِلْكَـٰفِرِينَ", "translation": "And for the disbelievers"}, {"text": "عَذَابٌۭ", "translation": "(is) a punishment"}, {"text": "مُّهِينٌۭ", "translation": "humiliating"}], "sahih": "How wretched is that for which they sold themselves - that they would disbelieve in what Allāh has revealed through [their] outrage that Allāh would send down His favor upon whom He wills from among His servants. So they returned having [earned] wrath upon wrath. And for the disbelievers is a humiliating punishment."}